भिन्दु॑ m. splitter, breaker, destroyer;
 drop (cf.
बिन्दु॑).

भिन्न॑ a. split, cleft, broken, destroyed, annihilated;
loosened, opened, burst, blossomed;
 divided, disunited, seduced;
changed, altered, distinct, different from (abl.);
 mingled, mixed with
(instr. or —˚), cleaving or sticking to (loc. or —˚). — n. piece,
fragment.
